{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "长长的叮嘱清单  (A Thoughtful Checklist and Gossip Headlines)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Returning to her dressing room during her concert tour, Xin Huimei notices aromatic oils laid out by her agent on Chun Yuqiao's instructions. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这些东西摆在这儿，是什么意思呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "淳于总出国之前，专门给我列了一个长长的单子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "他说你巡演的时候他不在身边，让我一定要站好岗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "他还说你现场演出之后容易失眠，需要按摩缓解，又怕你对精油过敏。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "所以他叮嘱我一定要亲自盯着配好配方，刚刚才弄完。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "谢谢你啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "对了，这是今天朋友圈的一篇热文，讲的是你和淳于总的八卦，转发量特别高。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "作者是路条网的首席娱记，如果你觉得哪儿不合适，我让他们收一收。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "做艺人就要有点娱乐精神，他也没有进行人身攻击，不用了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "让他们把那张图片换一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "没问题，不过照这么说的话，准夫君这三个字就不是造谣喽？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "说正经的，这篇文章反响特别好，所有粉丝都觉得你们好事将近，全是祝福。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好了，不开玩笑了，我去叫按摩师过来。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这些东西摆在这儿，是什么意思呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the meaning of all these things laid out here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "淳于总出国之前，专门给我列了一个长长的单子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before going abroad, Chun Yuqiao wrote out a long checklist especially for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "他说你巡演的时候他不在身边，让我一定要站好岗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He said that while he is away during your tour, I must stay faithfully at my post.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "他还说你现场演出之后容易失眠，需要按摩缓解，又怕你对精油过敏。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He also noted you get insomnia after live shows and need massage relief, yet worried about your essential-oil allergies.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "所以他叮嘱我一定要亲自盯着配好配方，刚刚才弄完。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So he urged me to oversee mixing the formula in person, and I just finished.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "谢谢你啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you so much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "对了，这是今天朋友圈的一篇热文，讲的是你和淳于总的八卦，转发量特别高。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By the way, here is a viral post from today's feed about gossip on you and Chun Yuqiao, with huge repost numbers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "作者是路条网的首席娱记，如果你觉得哪儿不合适，我让他们收一收。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The writer is Lutiao's chief entertainment reporter; if anything feels off to you, I can tell them to tone it down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "做艺人就要有点娱乐精神，他也没有进行人身攻击，不用了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'An entertainer needs a sense of humour, and he made no personal attacks, so there is no need.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "让他们把那张图片换一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just ask them to swap out that photo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "没问题，不过照这么说的话，准夫君这三个字就不是造谣喽？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem—though by that logic, calling him your husband-to-be is not a false rumour after all?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "说正经的，这篇文章反响特别好，所有粉丝都觉得你们好事将近，全是祝福。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seriously though, the response to this article is great; all the fans think wedding bells are near and are sending blessings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好了，不开玩笑了，我去叫按摩师过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, enough teasing—I will go call the massage therapist in.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这些东西摆在这儿，是什么意思呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "淳于总出国之前，专门给我列了一个长长的单子。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "他说你巡演的时候他不在身边，让我一定要站好岗。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "他还说你现场演出之后容易失眠，需要按摩缓解，又怕你对精油过敏。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "所以他叮嘱我一定要亲自盯着配好配方，刚刚才弄完。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "谢谢你啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "对了，这是今天朋友圈的一篇热文，讲的是你和淳于总的八卦，转发量特别高。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "作者是路条网的首席娱记，如果你觉得哪儿不合适，我让他们收一收。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "做艺人就要有点娱乐精神，他也没有进行人身攻击，不用了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
