    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "说正经的，这篇文章反响特别好，所有粉丝都觉得你们好事将近，全是祝福。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "好了，不开玩笑了，我去叫按摩师过来。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Touched by Chun Yuqiao's quiet thoughtfulness, Xin Huimei takes the Lutiao gossip column in stride and asks only to swap the photo. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
